// --- ArenaFrame usage (Category C) ---
// PROTECT itself performs no arena allocation.  The SEXP objects it
// wraps (produced by allocVector / allocMatrix) are heap-allocated via
// std::malloc inside those functions and survive past ArenaFrame
// destruction.  The ArenaFrame guard governs only R_alloc / ALLOC
